WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.150
Hi there!

00:00:01.219 --> 00:00:03.710
This lesson covers two end-of-month jobs:

00:00:03.808 --> 00:00:05.847
paying back people who used their own money,

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:07.790
and sending the records to your accountant.

00:00:08.037 --> 00:00:11.070
With Tositeo, each one takes just a few clicks.

00:00:11.596 --> 00:00:13.966
Open Reimbursements, in the Finance group.

00:00:14.293 --> 00:00:18.526
Here are all approved own-money receipts and travel claims, grouped by person:

00:00:18.795 --> 00:00:22.046
the bank account to pay, each item, and the total to pay.

00:00:22.235 --> 00:00:23.406
For example Tuan:

00:00:23.581 --> 00:00:28.766
one receipt and two business trips, 529.67 € in total.

00:00:29.118 --> 00:00:32.001
Tick the people to pay, choose the Payment date,

00:00:31.951 --> 00:00:34.126
then click Create SEPA payment file.

00:00:34.744 --> 00:00:35.810
The file is ready.

00:00:36.158 --> 00:00:39.103
Click Download SEPA file, then go to your online bank,

00:00:39.053 --> 00:00:41.730
and upload the file where you send payment files.

00:00:42.159 --> 00:00:43.890
The bank pays everyone in one go.

00:00:44.239 --> 00:00:47.650
The items are marked as paid, and older files stay saved below.

00:00:47.997 --> 00:00:48.450
Note:

00:00:48.566 --> 00:00:51.330
SEPA files are for companies that operate in euros.

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:54.450
In other countries, just pay by bank transfer as usual.

00:00:55.097 --> 00:00:57.259
Next, open Export to accounting.

00:00:57.366 --> 00:00:59.499
Choose the period, usually last month.

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:03.899
Keep Only items not exported before ticked, so nothing is sent twice.

00:01:04.168 --> 00:01:05.899
Then click Download ZIP.

00:01:06.168 --> 00:01:10.599
The ZIP file has a spreadsheet with all the accounts, VAT and cost centres,

00:01:10.549 --> 00:01:12.059
plus every receipt image,

00:01:12.203 --> 00:01:14.059
and a PDF of each travel claim.

00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:15.977
Send this file to your accountant,

00:01:15.927 --> 00:01:18.299
or import it straight into your accounting software.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:23.379
The Months section shows how many items each month has not booked, booked,

00:01:23.329 --> 00:01:24.155
and exported.

00:01:24.561 --> 00:01:27.915
When your accountant has closed the books for a month, click Close month.

00:01:28.264 --> 00:01:30.395
A closed month takes no new bookings:

00:01:30.664 --> 00:01:33.195
a receipt added late goes into the next open month.

00:01:33.542 --> 00:01:35.675
If you need to fix something, click Open again.

00:01:36.292 --> 00:01:37.852
That's the end-of-month work done.

00:01:38.015 --> 00:01:41.326
If your accountant uses Tositeo too, they fetch the data themselves,

00:01:41.276 --> 00:01:43.052
and you don't need to send anything.

00:01:43.286 --> 00:01:45.692
In the next lesson, we'll connect with your accountant.

00:01:45.945 --> 00:01:47.052
Now take the quiz below.
